---
description: Feature folders in Next.js apps — no cross-feature imports
globs: apps/*/src/**/*.{ts,tsx}
alwaysApply: false
---

# Feature modules

- `app/` — routes only. Import `@/features/<name>`.
- `features/<name>/` — one domain. Add `components/`, `hooks/`, `lib/`, `server/queries/`, `server/actions/` as needed. Relative imports inside the feature; never `@/features/...` from another feature.
- `shared/` — this app only; never import a feature.
- Cross-app libraries go in `packages/`.
